### Sanity check
GET http://localhost:8000/

### List models
GET http://localhost:8000/models

### List agents
GET http://localhost:8000/agents

### Create the default Research Agent
POST http://localhost:8000/agents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Research Agent",
  "system_prompt": "You are a concise research assistant. Find verified information from the web and report it tightly. Always cite sources.",
  "model": "qwen2.5:7b",
  "temperature": 0.3,
  "enabled_tools": ["web_search", "read_url"]
}

### Get one agent
GET http://localhost:8000/agents/1

### Update an agent
PUT http://localhost:8000/agents/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Research Agent v2",
  "system_prompt": "You are an even more concise research assistant.",
  "model": "qwen2.5:7b",
  "temperature": 0.2,
  "enabled_tools": ["web_search", "read_url"]
}

### Send a research question
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the current population of Bacolod City? [BRIEF]",
  "agent_id": 1
} 

### Delete an agent
DELETE http://localhost:8000/agents/1